<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>From this Christ to God ascended</l><l>Hath the Spirit been outpoured,</l><l>Poured upon the Church, His Body,</l><l>That His members be empow’red;</l><l>Thus the Lord of all in heaven</l><l>Thru His Church will be adored.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the flesh by incarnation,</l><l>Into man He God hath brought;</l><l>By His death and resurrection,</l><l>Into God He man hath brought;</l><l>God and man together mingled,</l><l>In Himself is fully wrought.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now in heaven by ascension</l><l>He is seated on the throne;</l><l>All the lordship, all the headship,</l><l>He Himself doth fully own;</l><l>And by pouring out His Spirit,</l><l>He as such might be made known.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>By this outpour, His descension</l><l>On the Church was realized;</l><l>’Tis by this, that in His Spirit</l><l>All the Church He hath baptized;</l><l>Thus the baptism of the Spirit</l><l>Was forever actualized.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Hallelujah, ’tis accomplished,</l><l>And accomplished once for all!</l><l>Hallelujah, we’re included,</l><l>All included, great or small!</l><l>Praise Him, He hath sent the Spirit</l><l>And baptized the Church withal!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
